  "content": "\n\n<h1>附魔提取器</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=Discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fenchantment-extractor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/enchantment-extractor?label=Modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"许可证\"></a></p>\n<p>从盔甲、工具和武器中提取附魔！附魔提取结果现在可在铁砧上使用！！</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>👾 错误/问题反馈</h2>\n<p>请将任何错误/问题反馈至 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🛠️ 合成配方</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OvtX6mK.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>⌨️ 命令</h2>\n<p>获取物品：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot enchantment_extractor:enchantment_extractor</code></pre>\n<p>禁用：</p>\n<pre><code>/datapack disable \"file/enchantment-extractor.zip\"</code></pre>\n<p>启用：</p>\n<pre><code>/datapack enable \"file/enchantment-extractor.zip\"</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🪪 许可证</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/enchantment-extractor-data-pack/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🎁 服务器托管</h2>\n<p>自行搭建服务器可能是一个非常漫长、繁琐且昂贵的过程。</p>\n<p>但使用 BisectHosting，只需几次点击即可轻松获得专属服务器！他们提供全天候技术支持与快速响应服务，绝不会让任何问题阻碍你的体验！感兴趣吗？我们为你准备了专属优惠！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flullaby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/lullaby</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e840cd99-59f6-4b27-b542-3023cd08bdfe.webp\" alt=\"服务器托管\"></p>",
